  "markdown": "# Cryptography\n\nShor on 91, RSA factoring and the crypt split identity as callable doors.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Capabilities | 3 |\n| With an evidence predicate | 2 |\n| Predicates that hold now | 2 |\n| Live (need the network; checked by the live doors) | 0 |\n\n| Capability | Kind | What it does | Evidence | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [`cybersecurityOf`](../src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L80) | builder | The cybersecurity door set: Shor on 91, RSA factoring, the encrypt identity, crypt split and RAID, with what each verifies. | `cybersecurityHolds` | holds |\n| [`cybersecurityToolsOf`](../src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L173) | builder | The eight cybersecurity MCP tools (catalog, rsa, shor, cmodexp, iqft, shots, split, verify) with their man pages and handlers. | — | — |\n| [`encryptOf`](../src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L42) | builder | The split identity of theorem crypto: fused = split x share, recomputed; secrecy is reported false (it is an identity, not a cipher). | `encryptHolds` | holds |\n\nGenerated from the inline docs by `npm run docs`. Index: [docs](README.md).\n",
  "html": "<h1>Cryptography</h1>\n<p>Shor on 91, RSA factoring and the crypt split identity as callable doors.</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th></th><th></th></tr>\n<tr><td>Capabilities</td><td>3</td></tr>\n<tr><td>With an evidence predicate</td><td>2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Predicates that hold now</td><td>2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Live (need the network; checked by the live doors)</td><td>0</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tr><th>Capability</th><th>Kind</th><th>What it does</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Status</th></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/uuidna/qpu/blob/main/src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L80\"><code>cybersecurityOf</code></a></td><td>builder</td><td>The cybersecurity door set: Shor on 91, RSA factoring, the encrypt identity, crypt split and RAID, with what each verifies.</td><td><code>cybersecurityHolds</code></td><td>holds</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/uuidna/qpu/blob/main/src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L173\"><code>cybersecurityToolsOf</code></a></td><td>builder</td><td>The eight cybersecurity MCP tools (catalog, rsa, shor, cmodexp, iqft, shots, split, verify) with their man pages and handlers.</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/uuidna/qpu/blob/main/src/quantum/processing/unit/crypto.ts#L42\"><code>encryptOf</code></a></td><td>builder</td><td>The split identity of theorem crypto: fused = split x share, recomputed; secrecy is reported false (it is an identity, not a cipher).</td><td><code>encryptHolds</code></td><td>holds</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Generated from the inline docs by <code>npm run docs</code>. Index: <a href=\"/\">docs</a>.</p>",
